    "name": "MasterQuest Fantasy",
    "steam_appid": 2750540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/7263a5673a00b3321a8eb23d4ce0a53a.avif?t=1730880149\" data-has-big width=800 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MasterQuest Fantasy</strong> is a captivating role-playing experience that takes players back to the golden age of tabletop RPGs from the 70s and 80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It embraces the nostalgic charm of those classic adventures, inviting you to step into a world where imagination reigns supreme, and the unexpected lurks around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its procedurally generated world and a style that pays homage to the timeless fantasy of old, <strong>MasterQuest Fantasy</strong> offers a fresh experience with each and every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/62fa417af7f777e52e3be2bd5dc3cdd2.avif?t=1730880149\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two gameplay runs are ever alike. One adventure might lead you on a desperate quest to destroy a powerful trinket before the Dark Lord awakens, while another could see you locked in battle against the twelve mysterious Zodiac Knights who guard ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you might find yourself lost in a maze of enchanted forests, searching for the legendary Crystal of Shadows, and the next, you could be outwitting a cunning dragon in the depths of a forgotten mountain stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/e905928d772d89fa047d7a54b8ac2678.avif?t=1730880149\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The places you visit and the people you meet are never the same twice \u2014 from the mysterious wanderer who asks you to help him track a murderer, to the jolly peasant girl who invites you to play a game of snikzesfwhlingdir, each interaction and encounter is shaped by the unique world generated for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/02e05ed31780a1c97076e026baf7cef6.avif?t=1730880149\" data-has-big width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face perilous traps, deadly beasts, and powerful foes that will test your mettle. Death is not just a possibility \u2014 it's inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die in countless ways: perhaps valiantly battling a ferocious dragon to protect a village, falling in glorious combat against a horde of undead warriors, or slowly starving after getting lost in the barren wastelands of the Frozen Peaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, maybe your end will be less dignified: slipping on a patch of mud while fleeing a group of goblins, choking on a particularly large bite of pie, or accidentally triggering an ancient mechanism that floods the room with hundreds of rampaging chickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every death, a new story begins, and with it, new opportunities arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/608d20dcdfafcef971c141f17a508d2c.avif?t=1730880149\" width=774 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on an endless journey, where every new adventure could be your greatest triumph \u2014 or your most devastating defeat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MasterQuest Fantasy</strong>, the only certainty is that no two adventures will ever be the same. How far will your imagination take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750540/extras/aa5658e1a419b8105566162f7efe7aa4.avif?t=1730880149\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
